# ACT 1 · Bus still · POI: old man (thoughts).
OldMan: [i]Check-up at nine. They'll tell me to walk more. I walk plenty. To the bus, and back.[/i]
OldMan: [i]She used to pack me a boiled egg for these trips. Forty years of boiled eggs.[/i]
OldMan: [i]I should learn how to make one.[/i]
Ghost: Everyone on this bus is carrying something.
